<title>BELGIUM: EU cuts grain import duties.</title>
<headline>EU cuts grain import duties.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union will on Sunday cut duties on all grain imports, the European Commission said.</p>
<p>The duties, which are normally adjusted at the beginning and middle of the month, are based on changes in U.S. grain reference prices and exchange rates.</p>
</text>
